        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1332_4595.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, unnd was wir ehren,
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots vermoegend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>. Fromm, fürsichtig,
<lb n="3"/>ehrsam, wyß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonnders</unclear> guot fründt, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>lieb <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>. Was uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jüngst</unclear> gehalt-
<lb n="5"/>ner Badischen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jartrechnng</unclear>, inn der ernstlichen sach,
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">antreffend</unclear> die statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-5" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Arben</unclear> am</placeName> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-157" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bodensee</placeName>, unnd <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-78" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Horn</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> die beide <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeindenn</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner">Egnach</placeName> unnd <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-138" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Roggwyl</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="8"/>inn der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtgraffschafft</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thurgauw</unclear></placeName> gelegen, gehand-
<lb n="9"/>let, unnd was für mittel der religion halber, von
<lb n="10"/>den gesandten der siben orten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerer</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erer</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-69" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lucern</placeName>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-70" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Uri</unclear></placeName>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-71" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schwyß</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="12"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-72" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unnderwalden</unclear></placeName>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-10" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Zug</placeName>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-197" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fryburg</unclear></placeName> unnd <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-49" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Solothurn</placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwüsch</unclear>-
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ent</unclear> den bischofflichen <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Costanzischen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anwalten</unclear> unnd
<lb n="14"/>den bemelten vier <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeinden</unclear> gestelt worden sind,
<lb n="15"/>das werdent ir uß hieby liggendem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußzug</unclear> deß
<lb n="16"/>Badischen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abscheidts</unclear>, mit A. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezeichent</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstehn</unclear>,
<lb n="17"/>unnd darnebent von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jüngst</unclear> alda <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName>
<lb n="18"/>gehabten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rathsgesanndten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoempfachen</unclear> hab-
<lb n="19"/>en, was daselbs sy diser sach halber wyter
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ghoert</unclear>, unnd mit inen von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsandten</unclear> geredt
<lb n="21"/>worden syge. Uff was maß nun die von
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Arben</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mittsafften</unclear> sich über soelliche relig-
<lb n="23"/>ions mittel bedacht unnd entschloßen, das
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdent</unclear> ir uß hieby <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwahrter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschrifft</unclear>, mit B.
<lb n="25"/>signiert, die sy an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anndere</unclear> ort gestelt
<lb n="26"/>habent, ouch vernemmen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wölliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschrifft</unclear> die
<lb n="27"/>genannten vier <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeinden</unclear>, durch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> abgesandten,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hütt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgelegt</unclear>, unnd nebent <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzellung</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>irer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vilfaltigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thraeffenlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschwaerden</unclear>, der
<lb n="30"/>angeregten mitlen halber, unns gantz ernstlichen,
<lb n="31"/>umb hilff unnd rath gebaetten, damitt sy
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1332_4596.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/>by der Christenlichen Evangelischen religion, und
<lb n="33"/>dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gmeinen</unclear> landtsfriden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sider</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sibentzig</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jaren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">har</unclear> beschechen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> sy von den vorigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bisch</unclear>-
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">offen</unclear> darby <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelaßen</unclear> worden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">füro</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andere</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Thurgoeuw</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">blyben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegint</unclear>, unnd darvon nit
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jetzt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dergstalt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrengt</unclear>, unnd von dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">iren</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getriben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdint</unclear>. Wann nun
<lb n="39"/>unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">disere</unclear> sach von derselbigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wichtigkheit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weg</unclear>-
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear>, unnd das es nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nur</unclear> wenig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">persohnen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sond</unclear>-
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ers</unclear> ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">große</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzal</unclear> volcks <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berueren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuot</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear>
<lb n="42"/>ernstlich angelegen ist. Unnd wir darby be-
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trachtet</unclear>. Das, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wann</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lüth</unclear> mit
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soellicher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nüwerung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">betrengt</unclear>, unnd von dem landts-
<lb n="45"/>friden unnd unnserer Christenlichen religion, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dar</unclear>-
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erborrn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzogen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">harkomen</unclear> sind, wider
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewüßne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getriben</unclear>, oder ir vatterlandt zuver-
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear> getrungen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> solten, daruß aller-
<lb n="49"/>hand <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wütloeufigkheit</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unruow</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unheil</unclear> sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">als</unclear>-
<lb n="50"/>bald erheben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>. Habent wir nit
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">underlaßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear> noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soelliche</unclear> hand-
<lb n="52"/>lung an üch (als die wir üch bißhar <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Christenliches</unclear>
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ÿfers</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebhaber</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befünderer</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wahrheit</unclear>,
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Evangelischer</unclear> lehr unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glaubens</unclear>, erfaren,)
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ort</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsere</unclear> lieb-
<lb n="56"/>en Eydt: unnd religions <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnoßen</unclear>, gelangen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zulaß</unclear>-
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sidtmaln</unclear> dann (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erachtens</unclear>.)
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierinnen</unclear> gegen dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hern</unclear> bischoff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Costantz</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ernstliches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuschlahen</unclear>, noch wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuhandlen</unclear>,
<lb n="60"/>unnd derselbig mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> gründen von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soellichem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear>-
<lb n="61"/>haben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> unnd ernstlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abzemannen</unclear>, und
<lb n="62"/>also den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biderben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lüthen</unclear> inn irem anliggen zehelffen
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1332_4597.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="63"/>en wirt. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Welliches</unclear> dann uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesammen</unclear>-
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kunnfft</unclear> unnser der Evangelischen Stetten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear>
<lb n="65"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-73" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Glarus</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsanndten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komlich</unclear> unnd nach notturfft
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berathschlaget</unclear> werden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koendte</unclear>, was maß ein soell-
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">iches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zehanden</unclear> zenemmen, unnd mit dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>
<lb n="68"/><persName resp="#ner">Bischoff</persName> durch ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsampte</unclear> bottschafft hierumb
<lb n="69"/>zehandlen unnd zereden. So bittend
<lb n="70"/>wir üch hiemit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoeßisch</unclear> unnd fründtlich,
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellind</unclear> unbeschwert <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear>, unns by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeigern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>,
<lb n="72"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">enn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">loeuffers</unclear> botten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> bedencken und guotachten
<lb n="73"/>diser sach halber mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitheilen</unclear>, ob üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angedütete</unclear>
<lb n="74"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesammen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kunfft</unclear> unnd bottschafft sendung gefellig,
<lb n="75"/>oder etwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">annderes</unclear> für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßer</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuonlicher</unclear>
<lb n="76"/>ansehen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>. Als wir dann hierumb
<lb n="77"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glycher</unclear> wyß den annderen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obgemelten</unclear> Orten ouch
<lb n="78"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoschrybend</unclear>, unnd wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüßend</unclear>, das ir unnd sy
<lb n="79"/>allers das so zuo pflantzung unnd erhaltung, unß-
<lb n="80"/>erer wahren Christenlichen religion, ouch frid
<lb n="81"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ruow</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einigkeit</unclear> inn unnserm geliepten vatter-
<lb n="82"/>land dienen mag, wyter als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bißhar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befünderen</unclear>
<lb n="83"/>zehelffen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> unnd willig sye, unnd üch deß-
<lb n="84"/>halb diser handlung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nebent</unclear> unns unnd den and-
<lb n="85"/>eren Orten uff dasselbig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">end</unclear> hin gern ouch annem-
<lb n="86"/>en werdint. Gott welle üch unnd unns inn
<lb n="87"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">synem</unclear> gnedigen schirm erhalten. Datum den <origDate when="1596" cert="medium" resp="#ner">11.t
<lb n="88"/>Augustj. Anno 96</origDate>.
<lb n="89"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd Rath
<lb n="90"/>der Statt Zürich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1332_4598.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="91"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear>, fürsichtigen, ehrsamen
<lb n="92"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und
<lb n="93"/>Rath der Statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="94"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jnsonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear> fründ-
<lb n="95"/>en, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben Eydt-
<lb n="96"/>gnossen.
</p>
